/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 206 0 R
/T (In recent years, Artificial Intelligence \(AI\) has begun to play a significant role in linguistic research, particularly in discourse analysis. This study explores how AI-based tools can support researchers in analyzing spoken and written discourse in educational settings. As traditional discourse analysis often requires extensive manual coding and interpretation, AI technologies offer new possibilities for identifying patterns, key lexical items, interactional moves, and discourse structures more efficiently.)
/E (In recent years, Artificial Intelligence \(AI\) has begun to play a significant role in linguistic research, particularly in discourse analysis. This study explores how AI-based tools can support researchers in analyzing spoken and written discourse in educational settings. As traditional discourse analysis often requires extensive manual coding and interpretation, AI technologies offer new possibilities for identifying patterns, key lexical items, interactional moves, and discourse structures more efficiently.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
447 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 206 0 R
/T (This research focuses on the application of AI tools in examining classroom and online academic discourse. The study considers how AI can assist in detecting feedback strategies, teacher-student interaction patterns, and communicative features in educational contexts. At the same time, it critically discusses the limitations of AI, emphasizing that human interpretation remains essential for ensuring depth, accuracy, and contextual understanding.)
/E (This research focuses on the application of AI tools in examining classroom and online academic discourse. The study considers how AI can assist in detecting feedback strategies, teacher-student interaction patterns, and communicative features in educational contexts. At the same time, it critically discusses the limitations of AI, emphasizing that human interpretation remains essential for ensuring depth, accuracy, and contextual understanding.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
448 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 206 0 R
/T (The findings suggest that AI can enhance the analytical process by improving efficiency and organization, while serving as a supportive instrument rather than a replacement for the researcher. The study highlights the importance of combining technological tools with critical human analysis in contemporary discourse research.)
/E (The findings suggest that AI can enhance the analytical process by improving efficiency and organization, while serving as a supportive instrument rather than a replacement for the researcher. The study highlights the importance of combining technological tools with critical human analysis in contemporary discourse research.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [11]
>>
