/T (The study highlights how trust in AI systems, perceived control, and cognitive load influence acceptance decisions. The findings suggest that while AI-supported teaching can enhance efficiency and engagement, successful adoption requires addressing psychological barriers, providing adequate training, and ensuring transparency in AI operations.)
