/P 211 0 R
/T (The integration of corpus linguistics into language pedagogy has transformed how learners engage with authentic language data, yet specialized corpus applications in English for Specific Purposes \(ESP\) remain underexplored, particularly with non-linguist students. This study investigates the potential of implementing freely available specialized corpora in ESP classrooms to enhance terminological competence and foster learner autonomy.)
/E (The integration of corpus linguistics into language pedagogy has transformed how learners engage with authentic language data, yet specialized corpus applications in English for Specific Purposes \(ESP\) remain underexplored, particularly with non-linguist students. This study investigates the potential of implementing freely available specialized corpora in ESP classrooms to enhance terminological competence and foster learner autonomy.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
