/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 213 0 R
/T (Translating from one's native language to the target language is obviously a challenging task because it requires a sophisticated level of intercultural awareness and competence beyond simply finding word equivalents. No matter how machine learning and artificial intelligence have improved translation studies in today's digital era, human translations still serve as the basis for everyday spoken and written communications. In this respect, the development of learners' translation skills remains an important issue, particularly in English language teaching \(ELT\) departments.)
/E (Translating from one's native language to the target language is obviously a challenging task because it requires a sophisticated level of intercultural awareness and competence beyond simply finding word equivalents. No matter how machine learning and artificial intelligence have improved translation studies in today's digital era, human translations still serve as the basis for everyday spoken and written communications. In this respect, the development of learners' translation skills remains an important issue, particularly in English language teaching \(ELT\) departments.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
