/P 214 0 R
/T (Significance/Contributions: The paper contributes a transferable OCR noise taxonomy, a set of operational diagnostics for error-class profiling, and a methodological framework for documenting preprocessing decisions in historical corpus research across language sciences and corpus-based humanities.)
/E (Significance/Contributions: The paper contributes a transferable OCR noise taxonomy, a set of operational diagnostics for error-class profiling, and a methodological framework for documenting preprocessing decisions in historical corpus research across language sciences and corpus-based humanities.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [13]
