/Title (This research focuses on the application of AI tools in examining classroom and online academic discourse. The study considers how AI can assist in detecting feedback strategies, teacher-student interaction patterns, and communicative features in educational contexts. At the same time, it critically discusses the limitations of AI, emphasizing that human interpretation remains essential for ensuring depth, accuracy, and contextual understanding.)
/Dest [24 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2090 0 R
/Prev 2524 0 R
/Next 2353 0 R
