/Title (Natural Language Processing \(NLP\) is an important field that develops computers' ability to understand, interpret, and process human language. One of its key directions, sentiment analysis, focuses on identifying the emotional tone expressed in texts. Through sentiment analysis, texts are classified into positive, negative, or neutral categories. The main objective of sentiment analysis is to automatically interpret human opinions. The growing volume of textual data such as social media posts, reviews, discussions, and news has significantly increased the importance of this field. In modern times, companies widely use sentiment analysis to measure customer satisfaction, analyze user behavior, and identify market trends.)
/Dest [41 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1835 0 R
/Prev 2539 0 R
/Next 2358 0 R
>>
