/Title (In recent years, Artificial Intelligence \(AI\) has begun to play a significant role in linguistic research, particularly in discourse analysis. This study explores how AI-based tools can support researchers in analyzing spoken and written discourse in educational settings. As traditional discourse analysis often requires extensive manual coding and interpretation, AI technologies offer new possibilities for identifying patterns, key lexical items, interactional moves, and discourse structures more efficiently.)
/Dest [24 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2090 0 R
/Prev 2523 0 R
/Next 2500 0 R
>>
