/Title (The results of the pedagogical experiment demonstrate that corpus-assisted instruction significantly improves students' ability to recognize gendered language patterns, interpret sociolinguistic variation, and produce culturally appropriate translations. The findings suggest that integrating corpus linguistics with gender-oriented pedagogy enhances critical linguistic awareness and strengthens sociolinguistic competence in translator training.)
